  "name": "Implement RoundResult Value Object",
  "description": "Create the RoundResult frozen dataclass - capturing all attacks in a single round.\n\nFile: src/domain/model/round_result.py\n\nImplementation requirements:\n- @dataclass(frozen=True) for immutability (DR-01)\n- Fields: round_number (int >= 1), attacks (tuple[AttackResult, ...]), attacker_state (Character), defender_state (Character)\n- CRITICAL DR-06: First attack in tuple is from initiative winner (Attacker Advantage)\n- Property: round_ended_in_death = defender_state.hp == 0 or attacker_state.hp == 0",
  "motivation": "RoundResult captures complete round state including attack order (DR-06 Attacker Advantage)",
  "estimated_hours": 0.25,
  "execution_agent": "software-crafter",
  "dependencies": ["01-01"],
